{"categories":[],"data_as_of":"2026-11-12T18:43:19Z","description":"本站近 30 天收录的 Prompt 工程 相关证据与变化。","evidence":[{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_75652dc861592c234e2fae4d15983948199915ef11c45d74b7e69306b21913aa","internal_url":"/posts/20261113-blogs_podcasts-optimizing-cost-per-task-and-proving-agent-roi-on--0-409a77b0b1/","observation_id":"obs_409a77b0b17a5148c50fa2d34fd8e289467f415901180490ea46c922f91886bd","published_at":"2026-11-12T18:43:19Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这套方法不再只看模型的 token 单价，而是按完整任务核算成本，并纳入分词效率、输出冗长度、代理循环次数和推理开销。它还通过人工基线、对照实验和五维评分卡，衡量智能体相对人工的表现与投资回报。","title":"Optimizing cost per task and proving agent ROI on Amazon Bedrock"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_334f59cf098e7f637657ae0b8e4f421c7eb680e9141e248df31f58dce8db47f4","internal_url":"/posts/20261112-blogs_podcasts-build-autonomous-ai-agents-with-amazon-bedrock-and-0-df6566d4fc/","observation_id":"obs_df6566d4fc91840890def19461933475d9c7a30723709bdf51469ad99565d346","published_at":"2026-11-12T01:18:23Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一篇面向 Java 团队的实战指南，介绍如何结合 Spring AI 与 Amazon Bedrock 构建可规划任务、调用工具并保留上下文的自主 AI 智能体。示例涵盖单智能体旅行助手和多智能体文档处理系统。","title":"Build autonomous AI agents with Amazon Bedrock and Spring AI"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_41d3f459fdf663c57644e0e2751ead5861c390fbdd58b9793d32be7cc3125a0a","internal_url":"/posts/20261112-blogs_podcasts-the-attendees-guide-to-the-aws-reinvent-2026-aiml--0-e3fb265c4a/","observation_id":"obs_e3fb265c4a7f0c03e332381c674e35ece02aac3c1eec6df11ee65ed9b8e8bec6","published_at":"2026-11-11T21:05:59Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一份面向 AWS re:Invent 2026 AI/ML 专题的参会指南，介绍不同会话形式，并按 AI 芯片、模型训练与推理、智能体开发及管理等层级整理相关学习内容。内容还梳理了 AWS 从基础设施到智能体解决方案的 AI 技术栈。","title":"The attendee’s guide to the AWS re:Invent 2026 AI/ML track"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_ef45433b032bc579e197be1c644e0ea3e441835116fed8a0b8d4f1a1949fee7e","internal_url":"/posts/20261111-blogs_podcasts-the-agent-evaluation-playbook-built-in-deepeval-an-0-6d77a575f5/","observation_id":"obs_6d77a575f579de9bddf060a1269b34c406ecd2d2de042436b64417f39ef25e85","published_at":"2026-11-10T22:35:03Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一篇关于智能体评估实践的技术文章，介绍如何以业务目标为起点，将成功标准拆解为可观察行为，再映射到轨迹级或会话级评估器。文章重点讲解 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Evaluations 中内置评估器、DeepEval 和 AutoEval 的用途及组合方式。","title":"The agent evaluation playbook: Built-in, DeepEval, and AutoEval on Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Evaluations"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_c72da122802c78cfeb42acc15d57a8ffa56c6bba7956625ffe0559f88634a1c4","internal_url":"/posts/20261112-arxiv-autoscaffold-ai-guided-scaffolding-for-reinforceme-1-283f892f9c/","observation_id":"obs_283f892f9c4f657a50323449300c5e6de7e0f8c29be06b2e06c04cf6c3632ef6","published_at":"2026-11-10T18:58:46Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"AutoScaffold 是一种面向强化学习的自适应辅助框架：由冻结的教师模型分析学生的训练经验，诊断不同任务中的瓶颈，并动态设计通用策略或针对性提示。辅助内容会在评估阶段移除，训练后的学生模型在四个任务领域均优于对应的强化学习基线。","title":"AutoScaffold: AI-Guided Scaffolding for Reinforcement Learning of Language Models"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_b192c524a4542db04537d2b0d9fb88f43d605572fa6606a05a35b63f4dad4c81","internal_url":"/posts/20261109-blogs_podcasts-how-stanford-teaches-ai-native-engineering-mihail--0-2c00110bd6/","observation_id":"obs_2c00110bd6231e5944e32b7c2b10255f3721d5597aa09b393fd97b57c877a8f7","published_at":"2026-11-08T21:41:44Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一段对 Stanford 课程教师、Monaco AI 负责人 Mihail Eric 的访谈，讨论 AI 时代软件工程师需要学习什么，以及编码代理如何进入课程、代码审查、故障排查和软件交付流程。","title":"How Stanford Teaches AI-Native Engineering — Mihail Eric, Monaco"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_27d7cfc3822ac623dd4a5f8737112573d31ab225a894bcf630b7e6d4e83477ba","internal_url":"/posts/20261107-blogs_podcasts-sagemaker-inference-now-supports-multi-instance-gp-0-819549b983/","observation_id":"obs_819549b983fd9118af23e6dd5e48bbf3e95ea8e30cf14630f24b1b5f1369fa27","published_at":"2026-11-06T18:01:00Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"Amazon SageMaker Inference 现支持使用 NVIDIA Multi-Instance GPU（MIG）将一块物理 GPU 划分为多个独立分区，让不同模型共享同一块 GPU，同时获得硬件层面的资源隔离和更合适的算力规格。","title":"SageMaker Inference now supports Multi-Instance GPU to maximize GPU utilization for model endpoints"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_d1fb334d50dabd2939a698e52348a32ed767b5af7ed03e4beb97c88eb661747a","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-blogs_podcasts-getting-started-with-web-answer-on-amazon-bedrock--0-614ec411e8/","observation_id":"obs_614ec411e822a540898f15e570bc65f7c99b1de4d8e763c931bcb2cccaf8f043","published_at":"2026-11-05T21:04:24Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的 Web Answer 现已正式可用。开发者只需调用一次工具，即可获得基于当前网页信息、由模型综合生成并附带来源链接的回答，无需自行搭建搜索、检索、内容清洗和引用提取流程。","title":"Getting started with Web Answer on Amazon Bedrock AgentCore"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_55ddf86c9959f04eb5b28cb59a45eae2953dd8833eab0fc00702bb68a79ad96a","internal_url":"/posts/20261108-arxiv-the-power-of-meta-access-in-the-software-of-the-fu-4-edac4f01e1/","observation_id":"obs_edac4f01e102df97edc3a99bedad0e47900118ca8eb5521c8a967fd32e30b8c0","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:22:24Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"当前保存的是来源摘要，不代表论文全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"The Power of Meta Access in the Software of the Future --- Demonstrated on LLM Chat UIs and Chat AI"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_0d40ab33453c1ffd45f8b8479389ebf75d40c8739f45f4bca22caeb204d73530","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-blogs_podcasts-how-amazon-marketplace-evaluates-content-quality-w-1-fad370bb7b/","observation_id":"obs_fad370bb7b6d436415c6f4ddb8a02e1562eca0569d93ed1a33f1eed45345207d","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:06:43Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这篇文章介绍一种面向电商商品详情页的内容质量评估方案：用视觉语言模型理解整页图片、文字与布局的协同效果，再结合 OCR 可读性信号和 CatBoost 分类器，依据专家标注输出质量判断。方案还利用 SHAP 解释评分依据，并在 Amazon SageMaker AI 上覆盖数据接入、模型托管、监控等环节。","title":"How Amazon Marketplace evaluates content quality with Amazon SageMaker AI"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_6946cf536ab340e76842588cd231fa56c3c087cc3499c2db340bd1952f46e8f6","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-arxiv-a-framework-for-context-enrichment-and-selective-r-0-1ba2bc1e63/","observation_id":"obs_1ba2bc1e6399e93d4fd435a7c22726067a41e0e5dc538d05675de7d9f0122609","published_at":"2026-11-04T18:58:23Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这篇论文研究如何通过有控制地补充提示上下文，减少大语言模型智能体在语义不变改写下行为的波动，同时保持对社会环境变化的合理响应。作者提出“上下文增强”和“选择性稳健性”框架，并在囚徒困境类博弈中进行了验证。","title":"A Framework for Context Enrichment and Selective Robustness in LLM Social Agents"}],"graph_node_id":"tag:Prompt 工程","id":"tag:Prompt 工程","related_topics":[{"cooccurrence":9,"graph_node_id":"tag:大语言模型","id":"tag:大语言模型","jaccard":0.818182,"topic":"大语言模型"},{"cooccurrence":8,"graph_node_id":"tag:AI Agent","id":"tag:AI Agent","jaccard":0.727273,"topic":"AI Agent"},{"cooccurrence":4,"graph_node_id":"tag:机器学习","id":"tag:机器学习","jaccard":0.363636,"topic":"机器学习"},{"cooccurrence":4,"graph_node_id":"tag:生成式 AI","id":"tag:生成式 AI","jaccard":0.363636,"topic":"生成式 AI"},{"cooccurrence":3,"graph_node_id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock","id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock","jaccard":0.272727,"topic":"Amazon Bedrock"},{"cooccurrence":3,"graph_node_id":"tag:Technical How-to","id":"tag:Technical How-to","jaccard":0.272727,"topic":"Technical How-to"},{"cooccurrence":2,"graph_node_id":"tag:Advanced (300)","id":"tag:Advanced (300)","jaccard":0.181818,"topic":"Advanced (300)"},{"cooccurrence":2,"graph_node_id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock AgentCore","id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock AgentCore","jaccard":0.181818,"topic":"Amazon Bedrock AgentCore"},{"cooccurrence":2,"graph_node_id":"tag:Amazon SageMaker AI","id":"tag: